                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Average activation suppliers:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>(Total number of distinct suppliers that received an uncancelled order, up until and including the activation day) / (Total number of restaurants activated)</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
